  "summary": "Space now toggles the spider between walking and paused. `window.__TASK_STATE__` is an object `{ walking: boolean }` that starts as `true` and flips on each Space press. The animation clock only advances while walking, so pausing freezes the legs and body in their current pose and resuming continues from that pose. Key auto-repeat is ignored and the page's default Space scroll is suppressed. `typecheck` passes. I didn't run `render` or press Space in a browser, so the toggle itself is untested."
